{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1786881841357429012,"compiled_state":{"alias":"grindable-deviant-angwantibo","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"be676ff1dc1f666c198dc594734c240d386256695b1e05fb479376253967ae16","event_uuid":"38380788-f44d-4d0d-ae95-90691074253f","position":{"commit_sha":"5494a7872776c45d47b58d9ac5361ab0a1f63f00","position":"1786877315033783001-38380788-f44d-4d0d-ae95-90691074253f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"47b394ca091e13093631522fb7eac8a073465ddf51eb85fc02aae0cfff9551ab","event_uuid":"90a02475-b810-4c33-b2fc-616e1cb8107a","position":{"commit_sha":"50ca121796d5abf616ee867624c08f9da6dd6c2c","position":"1786877324667349001-90a02475-b810-4c33-b2fc-616e1cb8107a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1786877315033783001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"90a02475-b810-4c33-b2fc-616e1cb8107a","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"760f-608f-4c69-449a"}],"description":"## Context\nDiscovered while validating courageous-deserving-manatee. The exact extras-enforced default-suite command selected 13,600 tests and finished with one unrelated failure after 1:33:35: `tests/unit/test_test_suite_store_isolation.py::test_plan_review_outage_unit_test_does_not_write_ambient_store`.\n\n## Proven failure\nThe outer helper launches `tests/unit/test_gate_engine_cutover.py::test_plan_review_workflow_outage_degrades_to_unsigned_indeterminate` in a captured subprocess with a 90-second timeout. The inner pytest prints `.[100%]`, proving its assertion completed, but intermittently does not terminate; `subprocess.communicate()` times out and kills the Python process. The focused outer node reproduced the same `TimeoutExpired` in 105.55s under `REBAR_REQUIRE_EXTRAS=1`. Without a code change, a later focused execution passed in 1.49s, proving a flaky shutdown/liveness class rather than an authorship regression. The identical full suite without the environment guard had already passed 13,575 tests in 1:29:34.\n\nThis differs from closed bug 89d5-61da-b621-47f8: that ticket added a CI hang watchdog but did not identify or fix this named nested-process shutdown failure.\n\n## Plan\n- Build a bounded reproduction around the captured inner pytest process and inspect its process/thread/pipe ownership after the test reports 100%.\n- Identify the resource that prevents interpreter exit (thread, child process, inherited pipe, or plugin teardown) and prove the mechanism with a discriminating A/B under `REBAR_REQUIRE_EXTRAS=1`.\n- Fix the lifecycle owner rather than extending the 90-second timeout or retrying until green.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A deterministic or fault-injected RED test names the resource that keeps the successful inner pytest process alive.\n- [ ] The fix makes the captured inner process exit normally and preserves the ambient-store non-mutation assertions.\n- [ ] A repeated focused stress run under `REBAR_REQUIRE_EXTRAS=1` completes without timeout.\n- [ ] The CI-faithful extras-enforced default-suite selection passes without this timeout.\n\n## Non-overlap\nDo not modify `src/rebar/attest/authorship.py` or `src/rebar/attest/authorship_resolution.py`; this is independent test-lifecycle work.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["ci","flaky","test-isolation"],"ticket_id":"bf7c-333e-29b0-4ee4","ticket_type":"bug","title":"REBAR_REQUIRE_EXTRAS store-isolation child can hang after pytest reports 100%","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["38380788-f44d-4d0d-ae95-90691074253f","90a02475-b810-4c33-b2fc-616e1cb8107a"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786881841357429012,"uuid":"2f2ef8dc-e7b2-4ef9-abe1-11930ec71eba"}